minesweeper-cli: minesweeper-cli (minesweeper games for the terminal)
minesweeper-cli:
minesweeper-cli: Two minesweeper games that run in a text terminal. mine-classic is
minesweeper-cli: the classic game, with a safe first dig, chording, flags and
minesweeper-cli: question marks. mine-path is the pathfinder game: walk from one
minesweeper-cli: corner of a hidden minefield to the other, scored on time and on
minesweeper-cli: how much you explored. Both have a live timer, a pause key, a
minesweeper-cli: daily challenge, replayable seeds and a top-5 score table per
minesweeper-cli: difficulty.
